<title>JAPAN: MOF likely to offer T-bills on Wednesday - sources.</title>
<headline>MOF likely to offer T-bills on Wednesday - sources.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance is likely to offer Treasury bills through a price-competitive auction on Wednesday, market sources said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The issue will likely be the roll-over of about one trillion yen worth of three-month T-bills issued in July, market sources said.</p>
</text>
